>> servings: 4

Dice @butternut{1} in small cubes and roast in the oven with @olive oil{} until cooked through and crispy.

Wash and finely chop @kale{1%bag}.

Massage with juice of @lemon{1/2} and @olive oil{}.

Chop @baby tomatoes{1%punnet}, @avocado{1} and @parsley{1%bunch}.

Drain @chickpeas{1%can} and @white beans{1%can}.

Toast @pumpkin seeds{50%g} in a dry pan until golden.

Remove roasted @butternut{} from oven and cool.

Prepare tahini dressing. Mix @tahini{1%tbsp}, @lemon{1/2} juice, @honey{1%tsp}, minced @garlic{1%clove}, @dijon mustard{1%tsp} and @olive oil{}, @salt{} and @pepper{} to taste.

Add iced cold water to preferred runniness and whisk until creamy.

Add all salad ingredients to the bowl, add the salad dressing, mix together.

Enjoy <3
